WEBVTT

00:03:47.640 --> 00:03:49.600
Were you able to capture
Number 0?

00:03:49.680 --> 00:03:52.600
Currently, Arachne is on that.

00:03:53.610 --> 00:03:56.610
We need to recalibrate Cyclops.

00:03:56.780 --> 00:03:58.440
I'll get right on it.

00:03:59.400 --> 00:04:03.620
The poor stone clarity is having
an effect on the exterior.

00:04:03.620 --> 00:04:07.370
But, getting a higher-ranked
stone would mean...

00:04:09.370 --> 00:04:11.920
...having to get one of theirs.

00:04:13.290 --> 00:04:16.290
No, we don't have to do that yet.

00:04:56.380 --> 00:04:59.840
Alrighty, time for your treatment.

00:05:01.550 --> 00:05:06.850
If you don't get this,
you'll turn into a mutant.

00:05:07.350 --> 00:05:11.390
You'll experience pain, but that's
the side effect you'll have to endure.

00:05:14.060 --> 00:05:16.480
Time to start the process.

00:05:46.550 --> 00:05:47.470
Fei!

00:05:50.060 --> 00:05:51.350
You...

00:05:53.020 --> 00:05:54.390
I'm so sorry.

00:05:55.480 --> 00:06:00.570
The serum made from my blood
isn't that effective.

00:06:00.900 --> 00:06:03.740
No more. If you do, you'll die.

00:06:03.740 --> 00:06:08.820
But, if you don't get the serum, Naito,
you'll become a permanent Dark Stone.

00:06:09.490 --> 00:06:10.990
There's another way.

00:06:13.750 --> 00:06:17.960
We need to get our hands
on a more concentrated serum.

00:06:18.960 --> 00:06:22.050
From... Ruri Aiba.

00:06:22.840 --> 00:06:27.380
I start today's lecture from page 185 of our textbook

00:06:27.590 --> 00:06:31.810
about "The Wealth of Nations", which explains
one mechanism of the modern market economy

00:06:31.810 --> 00:06:34.520
I taught you in our last class.

00:06:39.440 --> 00:06:40.480
Kagami?

00:06:43.110 --> 00:06:44.940
"Would you like to eat lunch together?"

00:06:45.610 --> 00:06:46.530
What?

00:06:46.530 --> 00:06:46.950
On the market economy in modern societies.

00:06:47.070 --> 00:06:51.120
Especially well-known is
the term, "Invisible Hand."

00:06:51.740 --> 00:06:53.080
Adam Smith thought that,

00:06:53.080 --> 00:06:55.000
Oh, this.

00:06:55.000 --> 00:06:56.620
Even if people carry out their productive
endeavors only in selfish manners,

00:06:56.620 --> 00:06:59.420
their society won't fall into confusion

00:06:59.420 --> 00:07:00.330
but rather, will be led to harmony and prosperity.

00:07:00.330 --> 00:07:02.040
"I made one for you, too! Ruri"

00:07:04.590 --> 00:07:07.970
Also, as you see on page 186 of the textbook,

00:07:07.970 --> 00:07:12.970
Adam Smith says in the book that
a goverment would need to do nothing but--

00:07:14.560 --> 00:07:16.810
Wh-what's the matter?

00:07:17.140 --> 00:07:18.520
Tandoji?

00:07:18.940 --> 00:07:20.600
Bathroom break.

00:07:21.560 --> 00:07:24.110
Go... go ahead.

00:07:43.840 --> 00:07:45.500
What are you doing?

00:07:45.670 --> 00:07:50.470
I was going to say hi,
but I thought you were asleep.

00:07:52.090 --> 00:07:55.930
I was worried.
You were away for so long.

00:07:56.100 --> 00:07:59.140
Yeah, I had to do something.

00:07:59.640 --> 00:08:01.480
Something? Like what?

00:08:01.480 --> 00:08:03.690
Whoa, too close!

00:08:04.690 --> 00:08:05.650
You...

00:08:06.020 --> 00:08:07.860
...always get so...

00:08:08.030 --> 00:08:09.860
...close...

00:08:09.860 --> 00:08:11.200
...when we talk.

00:08:11.200 --> 00:08:12.780
Really?

00:08:12.910 --> 00:08:16.950
How about we keep
a meter apart when we talk.

00:08:17.870 --> 00:08:21.750
Um, Alma do you want
to be by yourself?

00:08:21.750 --> 00:08:25.040
No, no, that's not the case.

00:08:26.040 --> 00:08:27.710
I'm just not used to it.

00:08:27.880 --> 00:08:29.050
That's all.

00:08:30.550 --> 00:08:32.760
So we'll give you
a crash course.

00:08:32.840 --> 00:08:35.800
What if I were to move
into your place?

00:08:35.800 --> 00:08:36.850
What?

00:08:39.560 --> 00:08:40.850
Just kidding!

00:08:41.730 --> 00:08:45.110
I understand.
I'll eat lunch by myself.

00:08:45.110 --> 00:08:46.150
Sure.

00:08:47.520 --> 00:08:48.730
Seriously?

00:08:48.730 --> 00:08:51.530
So you'll be OK if I get fat
from eating both lunches?

00:08:51.530 --> 00:08:52.860
Well...

00:08:53.240 --> 00:08:54.530
Nothing but trouble...

00:08:54.530 --> 00:08:55.530
Trouble?

00:08:55.700 --> 00:08:57.030
Do you mean me?

00:08:57.030 --> 00:08:58.950
No, that's not what I meant.

00:08:58.950 --> 00:09:02.040
I understand. I'll just go away.

00:09:03.750 --> 00:09:04.960
Um...

00:09:14.680 --> 00:09:16.050
I'm serious!

00:09:16.220 --> 00:09:19.970
Really, I'm going to go away!

00:09:28.060 --> 00:09:29.610
Yeah...

00:09:29.820 --> 00:09:31.780
Yup, trouble all the way...

00:09:53.050 --> 00:09:55.300
You've turned into a beauty!

00:09:55.300 --> 00:10:00.970
You know, sitting here, polishing these rocks;
it's what things will be like in our golden years.

00:10:00.970 --> 00:10:02.390
I know.

00:10:02.390 --> 00:10:07.730
It's like we should be sipping green tea,
looking over our garden.

00:10:08.060 --> 00:10:09.980
That's what's in my future.

00:10:10.480 --> 00:10:12.900
Right, Kagami?

00:10:13.190 --> 00:10:15.200
What are you saying?

00:10:15.200 --> 00:10:17.990
I'd be the one next to him.

00:10:17.990 --> 00:10:23.120
Right, Kagami?

00:10:23.120 --> 00:10:24.330
Ah, yes?

00:10:27.790 --> 00:10:30.130
There's trouble behind those smiles.

00:10:30.500 --> 00:10:31.840
Trouble...

00:10:32.210 --> 00:10:33.920
M-Miss Ruri.

00:10:33.920 --> 00:10:36.800
What do you think of the polish
on this stone?

00:10:37.880 --> 00:10:38.930
Miss Ruri?

00:10:40.430 --> 00:10:41.850
Are you OK?

00:10:44.020 --> 00:10:45.850
I was just thinking.

00:10:50.100 --> 00:10:54.530
Kagami, you don't know
how to polish rocks?

00:10:54.530 --> 00:10:58.200
You should have said something.
I can show you.

00:10:58.200 --> 00:11:00.110
Um, well no.

00:11:03.030 --> 00:11:05.870
You know, Tandoji isn't here.

00:11:06.080 --> 00:11:07.370
You're right.

00:11:08.000 --> 00:11:11.920
Tandoji is a big guy, so
when he's not around,

00:11:11.920 --> 00:11:15.460
it's like Kamakura without
its giant statue of Buddha.

00:11:15.760 --> 00:11:17.800
Y-Yes, I guess.

00:11:21.140 --> 00:11:23.760
Club leader, are you not worried?

00:11:23.760 --> 00:11:24.890
About what?

00:11:25.220 --> 00:11:26.430
Tandoji.

00:11:27.060 --> 00:11:30.900
Well, everyone has something going on.

00:11:31.150 --> 00:11:33.440
We should give him some space.

00:11:33.900 --> 00:11:36.780
He's probably just
collecting rocks at the river.

00:11:37.990 --> 00:11:41.410
I guess. It's troublesome, isn't it?

00:11:43.780 --> 00:11:44.870
Miss Ruri.

00:11:44.870 --> 00:11:48.080
It's almost time for the board
of directors meeting.

00:11:48.080 --> 00:11:49.290
Really, already?

00:11:49.290 --> 00:11:50.790
What?

00:11:50.920 --> 00:11:53.290
Kagami, are you leaving so soon?

00:11:53.290 --> 00:11:56.000
I-I'm so sorry.

00:11:56.000 --> 00:11:57.010
Oh, no!

00:11:57.010 --> 00:11:58.880
Well, let them be.

00:11:59.010 --> 00:12:00.800
Please excuse us.

00:12:00.880 --> 00:12:01.510
Sure thing.

00:12:07.970 --> 00:12:09.270
Hey, Wakana.

00:12:09.270 --> 00:12:11.600
If Kagami is going home...

00:12:11.850 --> 00:12:15.270
We should go as well, right?

00:12:15.270 --> 00:12:16.900
Hey, hey...

00:12:20.400 --> 00:12:24.160
To be honest, the meeting
saved me today.

00:12:24.450 --> 00:12:28.540
I just can't continue
polishing stones everyday.

00:12:29.120 --> 00:12:33.000
There are many things in life
that one cannot withstand.

00:12:33.000 --> 00:12:37.550
But doing that, it makes me
question my very existence.

00:12:38.880 --> 00:12:42.130
It must have been pretty bad
for you to complain, oni.

00:12:42.130 --> 00:12:43.380
It was...

00:12:45.260 --> 00:12:47.470
... most awful.

00:12:49.140 --> 00:12:50.180
Miss Ruri.

00:12:50.480 --> 00:12:53.310
Am I a troublesome woman?

00:12:54.150 --> 00:12:55.150
Huh?

00:12:56.560 --> 00:12:57.480
What?

00:13:02.570 --> 00:13:05.950
That was close. I was almost
split in half, oni.

00:13:06.120 --> 00:13:07.990
Are you OK?

00:13:08.120 --> 00:13:11.370
Yeah, it's just a little scrape.

00:13:11.370 --> 00:13:12.660
Are you in any pain?

00:13:13.670 --> 00:13:15.080
I'm alright.

00:13:15.210 --> 00:13:17.000
We'll head straight
to the hospital.

00:13:17.000 --> 00:13:19.630
No, I'm alright.

00:13:20.510 --> 00:13:22.590
I can't leave you like this.

00:13:24.510 --> 00:13:25.430
Ruri.

00:13:26.140 --> 00:13:27.010
Ruri!

00:13:27.470 --> 00:13:29.260
I sense a Dark Stone!

00:13:31.560 --> 00:13:32.560
What?

00:13:32.640 --> 00:13:35.100
Ooh, what are you doing to Ruri?

00:13:37.310 --> 00:13:39.270
Really, I'm OK.

00:13:39.360 --> 00:13:41.360
Sorry to have jumped out like that.

00:13:41.360 --> 00:13:41.940
Wait...

00:13:41.940 --> 00:13:43.030
I'm really sorry to have made you worry.

00:13:43.030 --> 00:13:43.900
Hey!

00:13:44.530 --> 00:13:46.030
What should I do?

00:13:48.660 --> 00:13:52.000
Vanished, like nothing happened.

00:13:52.450 --> 00:13:59.540
Miss Ruri. Miss Ruri!

00:13:59.540 --> 00:14:01.050
Miss Ruri!

00:14:04.420 --> 00:14:05.300
<i>Yes?</i>

00:14:05.300 --> 00:14:08.050
Emergency situation.
Locate Miss Ruri immediately.

00:14:08.140 --> 00:14:10.010
<i>You are not with her?</i>

00:14:10.010 --> 00:14:12.720
I looked away for a second
and then she was gone.

00:14:13.100 --> 00:14:15.940
Miss Ruri's cell phone
is currently out of range.

00:14:16.060 --> 00:14:19.310
There are no readings
from the GPS or sensors.

00:14:19.310 --> 00:14:20.400
What?

00:14:21.400 --> 00:14:23.150
Contact the police!

00:14:23.150 --> 00:14:25.070
Have them set up checkpoints!

00:14:25.190 --> 00:14:26.200
<i>Yes sir.</i>

00:14:29.070 --> 00:14:30.240
Miss Ruri.

00:14:43.420 --> 00:14:44.510
Kenmi!

00:14:44.590 --> 00:14:46.090
What?

00:14:46.090 --> 00:14:48.380
Ruri Aiba was reported missing.

00:14:48.380 --> 00:14:49.970
Miss Ruri?

00:14:50.090 --> 00:14:52.560
It must be the work of Naito Kijima.

00:14:53.430 --> 00:14:54.970
Unmistakably.

00:14:55.100 --> 00:14:56.600
Can you bring out the Cyclops?

00:14:56.600 --> 00:14:58.520
We're still working on it.

00:14:58.520 --> 00:14:59.650
Get moving!

00:14:59.650 --> 00:15:02.070
But you, you aren't healed--

00:15:02.070 --> 00:15:03.110
Who cares?!

00:15:03.440 --> 00:15:07.030
Aiba Foundation is in trouble, I have to go!

00:15:07.200 --> 00:15:09.570
If Naito has kidnapped Miss Ruri,

00:15:09.570 --> 00:15:13.660
then the next target is
undoubtedly Tandoji.

00:15:13.790 --> 00:15:15.240
That's true.

00:15:15.240 --> 00:15:16.790
Get ready to go, immediately.

00:15:16.790 --> 00:15:18.620
Is the Arachne ready to go?

00:15:18.620 --> 00:15:19.620
Yes.

00:15:20.420 --> 00:15:21.750
You'll do this, right?

00:15:22.290 --> 00:15:24.710
Again?

00:15:36.350 --> 00:15:37.430
Tandoji!

00:15:37.430 --> 00:15:39.640
We can't locate Miss Ruri.

00:15:42.360 --> 00:15:43.480
What?

00:15:45.730 --> 00:15:47.280
What happened here?

00:15:47.280 --> 00:15:48.360
I don't know.

00:15:48.610 --> 00:15:49.570
Calm down.

00:15:49.570 --> 00:15:51.450
I am calm!

00:15:53.450 --> 00:15:56.830
What do you mean, she vanished?

00:15:56.830 --> 00:15:58.200
I don't know!

00:15:58.200 --> 00:16:00.750
I stepped out of the car
for a split second.

00:16:01.250 --> 00:16:02.250
Her cellphone?

00:16:02.460 --> 00:16:03.670
It won't connect.

00:16:07.760 --> 00:16:10.680
<i>Mr.Kagami The search party
preparations are complete.</i>

00:16:10.680 --> 00:16:12.680
Understood. I'm heading over.

00:16:13.550 --> 00:16:15.140
I'll help.

00:16:15.140 --> 00:16:16.350
You stay here.

00:16:16.350 --> 00:16:17.430
Why?

00:16:17.520 --> 00:16:19.730
If a Dark Stone caused this,

00:16:19.730 --> 00:16:21.690
having you there will
be an inconvenience.

00:16:22.310 --> 00:16:24.060
If something happens
I'll contact you.

00:16:28.690 --> 00:16:30.570
Hey, wait a minute!

00:16:33.660 --> 00:16:34.700
He...

00:16:36.200 --> 00:16:37.700
Maybe he saw something?

00:16:45.540 --> 00:16:48.630
<i>I understand. I'll just go away.</i>

00:16:52.130 --> 00:16:56.300
What will I become...

00:16:56.850 --> 00:16:58.430
if she's gone.

00:17:00.810 --> 00:17:02.440
If I turn into a Dark Stone,

00:17:02.730 --> 00:17:04.730
I won't be able to turn back.

00:17:06.310 --> 00:17:08.190
What am I doing?

00:17:08.440 --> 00:17:13.200
I'm such a jerk,
only thinking about myself!

00:17:17.240 --> 00:17:18.410
Right now...

00:17:19.870 --> 00:17:21.620
He's our only hope.

00:17:23.620 --> 00:17:24.580
Hey...

00:17:25.880 --> 00:17:26.920
Are you alive?

00:17:30.630 --> 00:17:32.130
Damn.

00:17:38.430 --> 00:17:39.810
You're alive!

00:17:39.810 --> 00:17:41.600
Where am I?

00:17:41.600 --> 00:17:42.850
My house!

00:17:43.140 --> 00:17:45.650
Why am I at your house, oni?

00:17:45.650 --> 00:17:48.810
Don't you remember
splitting in two?

00:17:48.810 --> 00:17:49.860
Oni!

00:17:49.860 --> 00:17:51.610
I sensed the presence
of a Dark Stone!

00:17:51.610 --> 00:17:52.690
A Dark Stone?

00:17:52.780 --> 00:17:54.780
Ruri was abducted
by a Dark Stone?

00:17:54.780 --> 00:17:56.450
Abducted?

00:17:56.450 --> 00:17:58.870
Ruri was abducted, oni?

00:17:58.870 --> 00:18:00.620
No, that's what I'm asking you!

00:18:00.700 --> 00:18:03.450
We haven't been able to
locate her for a long time.

00:18:03.830 --> 00:18:05.580
Yes, oni.

00:18:05.710 --> 00:18:07.420
That feeling...

00:18:08.290 --> 00:18:10.630
No, this feeling is!

00:18:13.550 --> 00:18:14.670
It's Naito!

00:18:15.220 --> 00:18:17.930
Naito? You mean, Naito Kijima?

00:18:17.930 --> 00:18:20.720
Be careful, oni! He's nearby, oni!

00:18:33.990 --> 00:18:35.280
You...

00:18:35.280 --> 00:18:37.240
You're Kenmi's dog!

00:18:37.240 --> 00:18:39.660
I'm not a dog.

00:18:40.570 --> 00:18:42.830
Stay out of my way!

00:18:46.620 --> 00:18:47.620
What?

00:19:04.930 --> 00:19:05.980
Mr. Kenmi!

00:19:08.850 --> 00:19:11.900
It appears it's an evenly matched battle.

00:19:12.480 --> 00:19:13.980
What's happening?

00:19:14.230 --> 00:19:17.530
I'm usually the one
to engage in combat,

00:19:17.610 --> 00:19:19.320
but unfortunately I'm injured.

00:19:19.700 --> 00:19:23.030
So my security personnel is currently
out there capturing Kijima.

00:19:23.030 --> 00:19:24.580
Naito Kijima?

00:19:28.540 --> 00:19:31.880
Of course! Why didn't I realize sooner?

00:19:31.880 --> 00:19:34.500
It was he who abducted Miss Ruri!

00:19:56.400 --> 00:19:58.320
Bring it on.

00:19:58.820 --> 00:20:00.740
Don't underestimate me!

00:20:38.030 --> 00:20:40.900
I really hate him!

00:20:41.780 --> 00:20:44.450
I don't sense a Dark Stone
anymore, oni.

00:20:46.660 --> 00:20:50.330
Ooh, here she comes,
right here, oni.

00:20:53.370 --> 00:20:54.420
You OK?

00:20:56.960 --> 00:20:58.090
Yeah...

00:20:58.500 --> 00:20:59.670
What happened to him?

00:20:59.960 --> 00:21:01.010
He got away.

00:21:01.010 --> 00:21:02.510
I see.

00:21:03.340 --> 00:21:05.970
Well, the situation has
become more serious.

00:21:06.510 --> 00:21:09.060
Ruri is in imminent danger.

00:21:09.470 --> 00:21:10.770
We must get her back.

00:21:11.060 --> 00:21:14.940
There's no doubt he's using her
to create the serum.

00:21:14.940 --> 00:21:16.150
Serum?

00:21:16.150 --> 00:21:17.110
Yes.

00:21:17.110 --> 00:21:20.150
If he gets his hands on the serum,
he can maintain his sanity

00:21:20.150 --> 00:21:22.650
even while in a Dark Stone state.

00:21:22.990 --> 00:21:25.660
But in order to keep
making the serum,

00:21:25.820 --> 00:21:27.990
he'll have to keep Ruri captive.

00:21:27.990 --> 00:21:29.160
What?

00:21:30.830 --> 00:21:31.870
Alma.

00:21:32.460 --> 00:21:36.670
You must be worried about
what will happen to you if she's gone.

00:21:38.170 --> 00:21:40.630
But, you don't have to worry.

00:21:40.840 --> 00:21:43.130
I have some serum at the lab.

00:21:43.720 --> 00:21:48.010
If it becomes necessary,
you can use the serum.

00:21:48.100 --> 00:21:51.520
Are you saying that Ruri
isn't coming back?

00:21:51.520 --> 00:21:53.680
No, that's not going to happen.

00:21:53.680 --> 00:21:55.810
To make sure, we have to
use all our powers.

00:21:56.400 --> 00:21:58.520
You attached it to him
as we discussed, right?

00:21:58.730 --> 00:21:59.860
You bet.

00:22:00.820 --> 00:22:02.110
What are you talking about?

00:22:02.690 --> 00:22:04.780
We placed a transmitter on him.

00:22:05.030 --> 00:22:07.410
Start it up now and
find out where he is.

00:22:07.530 --> 00:22:08.570
Understood.

00:22:11.790 --> 00:22:12.950
Ruri.

00:22:22.130 --> 00:22:23.630
Blood...

00:22:23.630 --> 00:22:26.630
I need fresh blood.
